Lowercase letters (Basic Latin, codes 0 to 127):
abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
Uppercase letters (Basic Latin, codes 0 to 127):
ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ

The lowercase letters raised, and the uppercase lowered:
ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ
abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz

